        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFBP5000, Decorative Universal Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's Solid Brass 2-1/8 Inch Fancy Universal Door Stop is simple enough to fit in to any decor but the ridged edge adds unexpected flair. Easy to install, it is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. Includes mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFBP500-specifications.gif?v=1704354678\" width\"448\" height=\"274\" border=\"0\" atl=\"1-5/8\" Fancy Floor Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-5-8-inch-fancy-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufbp4505\">Fancy Top Door Stop</a></b> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-door-stop-ring-deltana-ufb4505rub\">Replacement Rubber Ring</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFBP5000 Decorative Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height of Rubber from Floor: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Dark Gray</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: #12 x 1-1/2\" screw plus plastic anchor.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/UFBP5000.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFBP5000 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 2-1/8 Inch Fancy Universal Door Stop",
                "description": "Decorative Universal Door Stop, Deltana UFBP5000 - Deltana's Solid Brass 2-1/8 Inch Fancy Universal Door Stop is simple enough to fit in to any decor but the ridged edge adds unexpected flair. Easy to install, it is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. Includes mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well. Available in 9 beautiful finishes.\r\n",
                "keywords": "deltana UFBP5000 Solid brass universal floor bumpers, del-UFBP5000, Decorative Floor Door Stops, wood door bumpers, wood door stops, steel door bumpers, steel door stops, doorstops, door dampers, rubber door stops, 2 1/8 inch high door stoppers, doorstoppers, wooden door stops, deltana universal Door Stops, modern door stops, contemporary door stops, decorative door stops, deltana fancy door stops, del-UFBP5000 Fancy Top Floor Door Stops, 2-1/8 Fancy Floor Door Stops, DEL-UFBP5000U5, DEL-UFBP5000U3, DEL-UFBP5000U10B, DEL-UFBP5000U15, DEL-UFBP5000U15A, DEL-UFBP5000U19, DEL-UFBP5000U26, DEL-UFBP5000U26D, DEL-UFBP5000CR003,"
